                            li #[strong &ldquo;Customer Materials&rdquo;] means the documents, files, templates, prompts, instructions, web-page imports and the contents of the open presentation that you or your Authorised Users submit to or process through the Service.
                            li #[strong &ldquo;Output&rdquo;] means content generated by the Service in response to Customer Materials, including proposed slides, decks, plans and answers.
                            li #[strong &ldquo;Project&rdquo;] means an isolated knowledge space within the Service that holds Customer Materials, conversation history and AI knowledge scoped to one client, opportunity or engagement.

